@extends('layouts.app')
@section('title','ETF Strategy Dashboard')
@section('content')
<div class="container"><div class="top"><div><h1>ETF 配息策略監控</h1><div class="muted">TWSE 真實資料・Laravel Server-side・每 5 分鐘自動更新</div></div><div><div class="muted">可投入帳戶金額</div><input id="account" type="number" min="0" step="1000" value="{{ number_format($accountAmount,0,'.','') }}"> <button id="save">更新並分析</button></div></div>
<div class="panel"><span id="status">初始化中…</span><span class="muted" id="updated" style="margin-left:15px"></span></div>
<div class="cards"><div class="card"><div class="muted">本月尚未除息候選</div><div class="n" id="candidate">0</div></div><div class="card"><div class="muted">買進候選</div><div class="n" id="buy">0</div></div><div class="card"><div class="muted">賣出提醒</div><div class="n" id="sell">0</div></div><div class="card"><div class="muted">預估最高股利</div><div class="n" id="dividend">NT$0</div></div></div>
<div class="panel"><h2>策略分析</h2><div class="muted" style="margin-bottom:10px">買進：今天仍在最後買進日前且帳戶可買至少 1 張。賣出：持倉已領股利，且目前股價產生的價差大於已領股利。此系統不送出委託。</div><table><thead><tr><th>代號</th><th>名稱</th><th>現價</th><th>除息日</th><th>最後買進日</th><th>發放日</th><th>配息</th><th>可買</th><th>投入</th><th>預估股利</th><th>報酬/價差</th><th>訊號</th></tr></thead><tbody id="rows"><tr><td colspan="12">讀取中…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
